# An Eternal Melody, the trigger area (mission.cop.an_eternal_melody#area). 2-4 current with Status 2 (a GM), in Tavnazian
# Safehold. After the warp and three zone ticks the walk into area 1 (cuboid -5..5, -24..-20, 18..27): 105; finished: the
# mission completes (Ancient Vows current). The earlier walk, at Status 1, enters the area too and answers nothing.
lists TavnazianSafehold/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/105
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=100,-42,41 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop AnEternalMelody current
charvar Mission[6][238]Status 1         # a GM
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 0,-22,22                           # trigger area 1, Status 1: nothing
walk 0,-22,10
charvar Mission[6][238]Status 2         # a GM
walk 0,-22,22                           # Status 2: 105
finish                                  # complete: Ancient Vows current
